  {
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "text": "Since the first trains crossed the valley, the village has measured distance in minutes rather than miles. The station clock is wrong by four minutes, and everyone knows it, and nobody has ever corrected it. A timetable pinned beside the door lists departures that no longer run.",
